{"id":"n5_u07_l1","unit_id":"n5_u07","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Location words","goal":"Say where things are: in front, behind, next to, inside, outside, left and right.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_soto","v_mae","v_ushiro","v_tonari","v_yoko","v_chikaku","v_hidari","v_migi"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Words that come after の","body":["Location words work like nouns: えき の まえ (in front of the station), つくえ の うえ (on the desk). You already know うえ, した and なか; now add そと, まえ, うしろ, となり, よこ, ちかく, ひだり, みぎ."],"examples":[{"ja":"えき の まえ","reading":"eki no mae","en":"in front of the station"},{"ja":"つくえ の よこ","reading":"tsukue no yoko","en":"beside the desk"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u07_lw01","q_n5u07_lw02","q_n5u07_lw03","q_n5u07_lw04","q_n5u07_lw05","q_n5u07_lw06","q_n5u07_lw07","q_n5u07_lw08","q_n5u07_lmt01","q_n5u07_ty01","q_n5u07_ty02","q_n5u07_gl01","q_n5u07_gl02","q_n5u07_gl03","q_n5u07_gl04","q_n5u07_vm_soto","q_n5u07_vm_mae","q_n5u07_vm_ushiro","q_n5u07_vm_tonari","q_n5u07_vm_yoko","q_n5u07_vm_chikaku","q_n5u07_vm_hidari","q_n5u07_vm_migi"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u07_lw01","q_n5u07_lw03","q_n5u07_lw05","q_n5u07_lw06","q_n5u07_lmt01","q_n5u07_ty02","q_n5u07_gl01"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u07_l2","unit_id":"n5_u07","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Places in town","goal":"Name places on a street.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_heya","v_niwa","v_kouen","v_ginkou","v_yuubinkyoku","v_honya","v_panya","v_konbini"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Shops and public places","body":["へや (room), にわ (garden), こうえん (park), ぎんこう (bank), ゆうびんきょく (post office), ほんや (bookstore), パンや (bakery), コンビニ (convenience store). ～や after a word means \"a shop that sells ～\"."],"examples":[{"ja":"パンや","reading":"panya","en":"bakery"},{"ja":"ほんや","reading":"honya","en":"bookstore"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u07_lmt02","q_n5u07_ty03","q_n5u07_ty04","q_n5u07_ty05","q_n5u07_dc01","q_n5u07_dc02","q_n5u07_dc03","q_n5u07_vm_heya","q_n5u07_vm_niwa","q_n5u07_vm_kouen","q_n5u07_vm_ginkou","q_n5u07_vm_yuubinkyoku","q_n5u07_vm_honya","q_n5u07_vm_panya","q_n5u07_vm_konbini"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u07_lmt02","q_n5u07_ty03","q_n5u07_ty04","q_n5u07_dc01","q_n5u07_dc02"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u07_l3","unit_id":"n5_u07","instructional_level":"N5","title":"In the room","goal":"Name things and animals around you.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_tsukue","v_teeburu","v_hondana","v_denki","v_eakon","v_inu","v_tori"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Furniture and animals","body":["つくえ (desk), テーブル, ほんだな, でんき, エアコン. Animals: ねこ (cat), いぬ (dog), とり (bird)."],"examples":[{"ja":"つくえ と いす","reading":"tsukue to isu","en":"a desk and a chair"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u07_ty06","q_n5u07_ty07","q_n5u07_vm_tsukue","q_n5u07_vm_teeburu","q_n5u07_vm_hondana","q_n5u07_vm_denki","q_n5u07_vm_eakon","q_n5u07_vm_inu","q_n5u07_vm_tori"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u07_ty06","q_n5u07_ty07"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u07_l4","unit_id":"n5_u07","instructional_level":"N5","title":"ここ・そこ・あそこ・どこ","goal":"Ask where a place is and point to it.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_doko"],"grammar":["g_koko_soko_asoko"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Near, near you, far, where","body":["ここ is near me, そこ is near you, あそこ is far from both. どこ asks \"where?\". Example: おてあらい は どこ です か → あそこ です."],"examples":[{"ja":"おてあらい は どこ です か","reading":"otearai wa doko desu ka","en":"Where is the restroom?"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u07_gd01","q_n5u07_gd02","q_n5u07_gd03","q_n5u07_gd04","q_n5u07_gd05","q_n5u07_gd06","q_n5u07_ty08","q_n5u07_vm_doko"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u07_gd01","q_n5u07_gd02","q_n5u07_gd03","q_n5u07_gd04","q_n5u07_gd06","q_n5u07_ty08"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u07_l5","unit_id":"n5_u07","instructional_level":"N5","title":"あります and います","goal":"Say that something exists and where it is.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_arimasu","v_imasu","v_arimasen","v_imasen"],"grammar":["g_ni_location","g_aru_iru"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Things and living things","body":["あります is for things; います is for people and animals. The negatives are ありません and いません.","Where something is: ほん は つくえ の うえ に あります. That something exists: つくえ の うえ に ほん が あります."],"examples":[{"ja":"つくえ の うえ に ほん が あります","reading":"tsukue no ue ni hon ga arimasu","en":"There is a book on the desk."},{"ja":"いす の した に ねこ が います","reading":"isu no shita ni neko ga imasu","en":"There is a cat under the chair."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u07_gn01","q_n5u07_gn02","q_n5u07_gn03","q_n5u07_gn04","q_n5u07_ga01","q_n5u07_ga02","q_n5u07_ga03","q_n5u07_ga04","q_n5u07_tr01","q_n5u07_tr02","q_n5u07_tr03","q_n5u07_tr04","q_n5u07_vm_arimasu","q_n5u07_vm_imasu","q_n5u07_vm_arimasen","q_n5u07_vm_imasen"]},"context":{"question_ids":["q_n5u07_gn05","q_n5u07_gn06","q_n5u07_ga05","q_n5u07_ga06","q_n5u07_ga07","q_n5u07_tr05","q_n5u07_tr06","q_n5u07_tr07","q_n5u07_tr08","q_n5u07_tr09","q_n5u07_tr10","q_n5u07_tr11","q_n5u07_tr12"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u07_gn01","q_n5u07_gn02","q_n5u07_gn04","q_n5u07_ga01","q_n5u07_ga02","q_n5u07_ga03","q_n5u07_ga06","q_n5u07_tr01"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u07_l6","unit_id":"n5_u07","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Kanji: 口 出 入 駅 店 町 家 学 校","goal":"Read the kanji you see on station and street signs.","introduces":{"kanji":["k_kuchi","k_de","k_iri","k_eki","k_mise","k_machi","k_ie","k_gaku","k_kou"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Signs in kanji","body":["出口 (exit) and 入口 (entrance) are on every station. 駅 is a station, 店 a shop, 町 a town, 家 a house, 学校 a school.","Kanji appear with furigana until you have learned them."],"examples":[{"ja":"出口","reading":"deguchi","en":"exit"},{"ja":"駅","reading":"eki","en":"station"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u07_kd01","q_n5u07_kd02","q_n5u07_kd03","q_n5u07_kd04","q_n5u07_kd05","q_n5u07_kd06","q_n5u07_kd07","q_n5u07_kd08","q_n5u07_kd09","q_n5u07_kk01","q_n5u07_kk02","q_n5u07_kk03","q_n5u07_kk04","q_n5u07_kk05","q_n5u07_kk06","q_n5u07_kk07","q_n5u07_kmt01","q_n5u07_kcf01","q_n5u07_kcf02","q_n5u07_kcf03"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u07_kd01","q_n5u07_kd02","q_n5u07_kd03","q_n5u07_kd04","q_n5u07_kk05","q_n5u07_kk06","q_n5u07_kmt01","q_n5u07_kcf01"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
